From 856e24c50b18e41630ae0cfaef7cd592bd638f6c Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: =?UTF-8?q?Kamil=20Postro=C5=BCny?= <kamil@postrozny.pl>
Date: Fri, 23 Oct 2026 14:56:49 +0200
Subject: [PATCH] vkd3d: descriptor cost diagnostics

Default-off checked same-thread elapsed scopes preserve descriptor copy vtable selection and copy shapes. Separate constants/redzone and RTV/DSV exclusions; retain raw counters, validity and nontransactional capture boundaries. Elapsed is not CPU time; native driver replay is independently covered.

Class: diagnostics
Evidence: docs/evidence/2026-10-23-vkd3d-descriptor-cost-probe-host.md
Offered-upstream: no
---
